Yes, indeed.[*]  Just take into account that sometimes the alchemy
results in an explosion, where _one_ potion from the stack and the
single potion you dipped the stack into will get lost. But you may
retry with the rest of the stack and another new potion to dip into.
Take care that the potions are non-cursed before doing the alchemy.
(A potion of gain level is a possible substitute for gain energy.)

> By then, I should have 80 more Max HP for 256.
> Is that good enough for a first ascention run? Or
> should I keep looking for more?

With your AC you are fine with 250+ HPs, especially since you have
an amulet of life saving that you'll carry for unexpected threats.

Personally I'd save some more than the three blessed potions of
full healing. But if you can kill the air elementals fast enough
and stay unburdened you may also be fine with just three potions.
Remember that being engulfed by vortices on the Plane of Air will
also give you time to rest and restore your HPs (but I think the
air elementals will approach nevertheless and when you leave the
vortex you may have unpleasant neighbours).

