If you don't want to waste the wish wait until you need it. A wand
of wishing doesn't have much weight, so you may delay your decision
until you need a wish. Though (if you don't have any spare wand of
death) at least one blessed scroll of charging should be present in
your bag!

It's not worth to charge up wands in advance (i.e. if they are still
fully charged), they would get only 1 more charge, IIRC. But if the
wands got empty the scrolls restore many points.

Don't wish for wands of polymorph.

I wonder why you don't have more than one wand of teleport, they seem
to be not uncommon until reaching the vibrating square. But okay, so
you want to have enough blessed scrolls of charging and additionally
a blessed magic marker (a recharged magic marker will always have 50
charges if recharged by a blessed scroll; but keep in mind that a
magic marker can just be recharged _once_).

